<title>USA: Knight-Ridder sees ad revs up in 1997.</title>
<headline>Knight-Ridder sees ad revs up in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Knight-Ridder Inc said it expects advertising revenue will likely increase in the low single digits in 1997.</p>
<p>The newspaper company also said it is optimistic that newsprint expense will be down about 15 percent in 1997, even with the impact of a possible price increase in the spring.  </p>
<p>Earlier, the company reported fourth quarter earnings per share of $0.79 excluding a gain versus $0.32 a year ago.</p>
